    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "703B8A8FDD7C1F31",
      "text": "I’m very intrigued by this specimen, but\\nalas, that’s not what we’re here for.\\c\\nWe’re here to go to the deepest depths of\\nArea Zero...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
