      "label": "sdc02_0250_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "7038888FDD79E5F4",
      "text": "Well, either way, we should start by making for\\nthe Zero Lab down in the depths.\\c\\nYou take the lead, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
